\section{What [[canvaslms]] gets}

A [[Section]] is what [[canvaslms]] prints under one heading.
The body is Markdown, which [[canvaslms]] renders in the terminal or
writes to a file as it is; the [[files]] are paths in the directory that
[[canvaslms]] gave us.
We keep the files apart from the body, rather than inlining them, because
[[canvaslms]] already knows how to turn a file into text: code becomes a
highlighted block, a PDF its text, anything else goes through Pandoc.
Doing that here as well would be a second, worse, copy.

