\section{The discussion posts}
\label{ViewDiscussions}

In a video or document activity the student's work is what they wrote in
the discussions (\cref{Discussions}).
A post on its own often makes no sense, a reply to a question say, so we
show every thread the student took part in, whole, and the author of each
post.
The threads of an activity cost a request per post with replies, so the
[[Activity]] fetches them once for all students.
We tell the student's posts by the author's id, which a [[Post]] keeps for
this purpose.

<<constants>>=
MULTIMEDIA_TASK = "multimedia-tasks"
DISCUSSION_TITLE = "Discussion posts"
<<functions>>=
def discussion_section(activity, users):
    """Return the `Section` of the threads that `users` took part in."""
    lines = []
    for thread in activity.threads:
        posts = list(discussion_module.walk(thread.post))
        if any(post.author_id in users for _, post in posts):
            for depth, post in posts:
                where = f"{thread.position}, " if depth == 0 \
                    and thread.position else ""
                lines.append(f"{'  ' * depth}- {where}{post.kind} by "
                             f"{post.author or 'unknown'}: "
                             f"{review_module.fold(post.body)}")
    return Section(DISCUSSION_TITLE, "\n".join(lines) or "None.")
